\begin_layout Subsubsection
Palette File Format
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
The palette files used in NetHackDS are simple text files.
 Any blank lines,
 or lines prefixed with a pound ('#') are ignored.
 All other lines must be bare six-digit hexadecimal values (lower-case characters only) representing RGB triplets.
\end_layout

